# Netlify redirects for a single site serving two domains.
# Primary domain: justinebraunresearch.com  |  Domain alias: squidbird.io
# Rules run top to bottom; the first match wins.

# 1) Anyone visiting squidbird.io sees the /squidbird folder, while the address bar stays on squidbird.io.
https://squidbird.io/*        /squidbird/:splat   200!
https://www.squidbird.io/*    https://squidbird.io/:splat   301!

# 2) Anyone visiting justinebraunresearch.com/squidbird gets sent to the real Squidbird domain.
/squidbird/*                  https://squidbird.io/:splat   301!

# 3) Tidy the www version of the personal site.
https://www.justinebraunresearch.com/*   https://justinebraunresearch.com/:splat   301!

# 4) The old project URL now lives on the Community page.
/draw-on-the-furniture/*      /community/#furniture   301
